NOT YET BUILT/VERIFIED (see README.md)
--------------------------------------------------------------------

This patch is a precise, minimal, reviewed source-level fix at the
correct layer, but has NOT been compiled or run against a live
code-server build in this pass -- doing so requires the full VS Code
build toolchain (a pinned Node version, yarn, native build
dependencies) and a multi-stage build (VS Code core, then code-server's
own wrapping build), which was judged infeasible to complete safely
within this pass's environment/time budget (see README.md "Build
feasibility" section). Line numbers above are illustrative
(`@@ -NNN,7 +NNN,26 @@`) and must be re-anchored against the exact
checked-out revision before applying.
